Third-party components bundled by this project
=============================================

The APK ships prebuilt binaries under app/src/main/assets/rootkit/ so that a
gradle build alone produces a working APK. Those binaries are NOT this project's
code; they come from SimpleSSHD and its bundled libraries.

1. SimpleSSHD  (GNU GPL v3)
   Upstream: https://github.com/galexander/sshd   (version 27, package
   org.galexander.sshd)
   Files bundled here:
     app/src/main/assets/rootkit/stage/lib/libsimplesshd-jni.so   (contains the
       JNI wrapper and the SSH server it embeds — Dropbear)
     app/src/main/assets/rootkit/stage/lib/libbuffersu.so
     app/src/main/assets/rootkit/stage/lib/libscp.so
     app/src/main/assets/rootkit/stage/lib/libsftp-server.so
     app/src/main/assets/rootkit/stage/lib/librsync.so   (the rsync library
       SimpleSSHD bundles; upstream librsync is LGPL-2.1 — verify against the
       build you redistribute)

   GPL note: if you redistribute an APK containing these binaries you must also
   make the corresponding source available. For unmodified upstream builds the
   upstream repository is that source. The launcher this project adds
   (`stage/simplesshd_dropbear_launcher`, built from
   `exploits/simplesshd_dropbear_launcher.c`) is shipped with its source in this
   repository under the same terms, so the whole SSH payload stays
   GPLv3-compatible.

2. Dropbear SSH server  (MIT-style licence, upstream)
   Upstream: https://matt.ucc.asn.au/dropbear/dropbear.html
   Not shipped as a separate file: SimpleSSHD's build embeds it inside
   libsimplesshd-jni.so, and the launcher calls its `dropbear_main`.

3. Nothing else is bundled. The app itself has no third-party dependencies
   beyond the Android platform (androidx is not used), and no analytics or
   network writes: the report uploader ships with an empty ENDPOINT and refuses
   to send anything until you set your own collector.

Before publishing
-----------------
* Confirm the SimpleSSHD version you ship and, if you patch any of those
  libraries, publish the patches. The copies bundled here are unmodified
  upstream builds of version 27.
